{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The random title pick is **Puck Wild**. I’m using the local game-toolchain skill and building a cel-shaded, ink-outlined arena around fast two-skater attacks, bank passes, body checks, and automatic goalies. The demo will include a full cup match, a playable training rink, local multiplayer, AI Hub online play, and an AI attract match."}}
