{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_42","type":"agent_message","text":"The scoring adjustment worked: the AI now creates goals as well as passes and checks, and all 33 initial checks pass. The arena also renders correctly through Three’s WebGL compatibility backend for visual inspection; this machine’s software WebGPU capture is unreliable, so WebGPU behavior is being verified separately through game state and the Hub harness. I’m finishing controller, touch, audio, and multiplayer checks now."}}
